function generated(\DOMElement $el):bool { for($n=$el;$n instanceof \DOMElement;$n=$n->parentNode){$class=' '.$n->getAttribute('class').' ';foreach(['product-card','album-grid','featured-thanks','recognition-grid','membership-card','document-list'] as $c)if(str_contains($class,' '.$c.' '))return true;}return false; }
function compile_page(string $key,string $html):array {
 global $global;[$d,$xp]=\NL\dom($html);$fields=[];$media=[];$links=[];$sections=[];$counter=0;
 foreach($xp->query('//h1|//h2|//h3|//h4|//p|//figcaption|//a|//button|//span|//li|//dt|//dd|//label') as $el){
 if(generated($el)||in_array($el->getAttribute('data-content'),$global,true)||$el->hasAttribute('data-contact'))continue;
 $skip=false;for($n=$el->parentNode;$n instanceof \DOMElement;$n=$n->parentNode)if($n->hasAttribute('data-cms-field'))$skip=true;
 if($skip||$xp->query('.//input|.//select|.//textarea|.//img|.//svg|.//video|.//button|.//a|.//div|.//ul|.//dl|.//figure',$el)->length)continue;
 $text=trim(preg_replace('/\s+/u',' ',$el->textContent));if($text==='')continue;$id='text'.(++$counter);$el->setAttribute('data-cms-field',$id);$fields[$id]=['label'=>mb_substr($text,0,95),'html'=>\NL\inner($el),'tag'=>$el->tagName];
 }
 $counter=0;foreach($xp->query('//img|//svg[@role="img"]|//source|//video[@poster]') as $el){if(generated($el))continue;
 if($el->tagName==='svg'){$image=$el->getElementsByTagName('image')->item(0);if(!$image)continue;$src=$image->getAttribute('href');$kind='svg';$attribute='href';$alt=$el->getAttribute('aria-label');}
 else {$kind=$el->tagName==='source'?'video':($el->tagName==='video'?'poster':'image');$attribute=$el->tagName==='video'?'poster':'src';$src=$el->getAttribute($attribute);$alt=$el->getAttribute('alt');}
 $globalMedia='';if($el->tagName==='source'||$el->tagName==='video')$globalMedia=$el->tagName==='source'?'workshop_video':'workshop_photo';
 for($ancestor=$el->parentNode;$ancestor instanceof \DOMElement;$ancestor=$ancestor->parentNode){$class=' '.$ancestor->getAttribute('class').' ';foreach(['brand'=>'logo','hero-visual'=>'hero_photo','story-photo'=>'story_photo','director-section'=>'director_photo'] as $cls=>$setting)if(str_contains($class,' '.$cls.' '))$globalMedia=$setting;}
 $id='media'.(++$counter);$el->setAttribute('data-cms-media',$id);$media[$id]=['kind'=>$kind,'attribute'=>$attribute,'src'=>$src,'original'=>$src,'alt'=>$alt,'global'=>$globalMedia,'label'=>$alt?:($kind==='video'?'Видео':($kind==='poster'?'Обложка видео':basename($src)))];
 }
 $counter=0;foreach($xp->query('//a[@href]') as $el){if(generated($el)||$el->hasAttribute('data-contact'))continue;$href=$el->getAttribute('href');if($href==='#main')continue;$id='link'.(++$counter);$el->setAttribute('data-cms-link',$id);$links[$id]=['label'=>mb_substr(trim($el->textContent)?:$el->getAttribute('aria-label'),0,100),'href'=>$href];}
 $root=$xp->query('//*[@id="cms-root"]')->item(0);$counter=0;foreach($root->childNodes as $node){if(!$node instanceof \DOMElement||!in_array($node->tagName,['section','header','footer','article','div'],true))continue;$id='section'.(++$counter);$node->setAttribute('data-cms-section',$id);$head=$xp->query('.//h1|.//h2|.//h3',$node)->item(0);$sections[]=['id'=>$id,'label'=>mb_substr(trim($head?$head->textContent:$node->textContent),0,85),'visible'=>true];}
 return ['html'=>\NL\inner($root),'fields'=>$fields,'media'=>$media,'links'=>$links,'sections'=>$sections];
}
